# Misconfiguration exceptions for `trivy config`. Every entry needs a reason.

# KSV-0110: trivy renders the chart without a release namespace, so it assumes "default".
# Real installs use `helm -n helmsman` into a namespace with Pod Security "restricted".
KSV-0110

